{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#card-zh","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 是一款面向 DSH web 客户端的页内查找插件，为桌面 Electron 壳补上对话内容与右侧扩展面板的搜索。它在客户端挂载自绘查找条，支持 ⌘F/Ctrl+F 打开、实时查找、全部匹配高亮、匹配计数以及 Enter、Shift+Enter、F3 和 ⌘G 导航。用户可以切换对话区或右侧面板，折叠区域会跳过并在展开后重新计数。适合需要在较长 DSH 会话或扩展面板中定位文本的用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:315-337","lib/client.js:527-567","lib/client.js:637-684"]}
{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#card-en","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-find-bar adds a find bar to DSH desktop web, searching conversation text or the right panel. It supports ⌘F/Ctrl+F, live matching, highlights, a count, and keyboard navigation. Collapsed text is skipped and rescanned when shown. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:315-337","lib/client.js:527-567","lib/client.js:637-684"]}
