{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#feature-1","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 的功能「查找条与实时搜索」：按 ⌘F/Ctrl+F 打开查找条，并以当前选中文字预填；输入查询后收集所选区域的文本并显示匹配数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:593-617","lib/client.js:315-337"]}
{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#feature-2","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 的功能「匹配高亮与跳转」：搜索结果通过 CSS Custom Highlight API 全部高亮，当前项单独标记；按钮或 Enter、Shift+Enter、F3、⌘G 可在匹配间移动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:357-397","lib/client.js:527-559"]}
{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#feature-3","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 的功能「对话区和右侧面板范围」：查找条提供对话区与右侧面板两种范围；右栏折叠时选择器隐藏，已选范围不可用时回退到对话区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:153-185","lib/client.js:451-478"]}
{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#feature-4","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 的功能「折叠内容更新后重搜」：搜索跳过隐藏文本，并通过 MutationObserver 在内容或可见状态变化后延迟重扫，使展开区域的匹配重新计入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:206-217","lib/client.js:406-420"]}
{"unit_id":"secyborg__dsh-find-bar#caveat-1","repo":"secyborg/dsh-find-bar","commit":"117bd30fbf6666b88f0b84574b029865b7cf2b0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-find-bar 只搜索所选栏中渲染且可见的 DOM 文本；不支持 CSS Custom Highlight API 时会退回 window.find()，此模式没有范围选择和匹配计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:39-46","lib/client.js:315-337","lib/client.js:400-403"]}
